
### Create merchant
POST http://localhost:8080/api/merchants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Atlas Store",
  "category": "ECOMMERCE"
}

### Get merchant by ID (replace with the ID returned by Create merchant)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/merchants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Accept: application/json

### List all merchants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/merchants
Accept: application/json

### List active merchants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/merchants?status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json

### List merchants by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/merchants?category=ECOMMERCE
Accept: application/json

### List active merchants by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/merchants?status=ACTIVE&category=ECOMMERCE
Accept: application/json

### Change merchant status (replace with the ID returned by Create merchant)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/merchants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}
